## Folder Structure

```
.claude/
├── templates/          # Document templates (symlinks to framework + local)
├── rules/              # Quality rules (symlinks to framework + local)
├── agents/             # Agent definitions (symlinks to framework)
├── validators/         # Validation scripts (symlinks to framework)
├── engineering/        # Working documents (NOT committed - gitignored)
│   ├── frd/           # Feature Request Documents
│   ├── design/        # Design Proposals
│   ├── test-plans/    # Test Plans
│   ├── reviews/       # Code Review Reports
│   ├── spikes/        # Investigation Reports
│   └── bugs/          # Bug Analysis
└── settings.local.json # Personal settings (NOT committed)
```

Note: SDLC slash commands come from the qwickapps-sdlc plugin, not from a local commands/ directory.

