## Customization

### Adding Project-Specific Rules

Create files in `.claude/rules/` (not symlinks):

```bash
cat > .claude/rules/PROJECT-CONVENTIONS.md << 'EOF'
# Project Conventions

## Naming
- Use PascalCase for components
- Use camelCase for functions
...
EOF
```

To customize workflows, create project-specific rules in `.claude/rules/` or override the plugin's behavior with local settings.

---

## Updates

This project uses [ai-sdlc-workflows](https://github.com/qwickapps/ai-sdlc-workflows).

To update the framework:
```bash
~/.ai-sdlc-workflows/update.sh
```

All symlinked files are automatically updated. Local customizations are preserved.
